Design to construction, materials, drawings and tests (@pe-construction: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @electrical-power-engineering, #source "../sources/Hydroelectric-Mechanical-and-Electrical-Design-USACE.lingua#r_1N0D32HTSXMVJ1VRW9TNTYV9P8", #source "../sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30", #source "../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP", #source "../sources/Electrical-Standards-Edition-and-Jurisdiction.lingua#r_169QEF26N0C345MKSRWQY6KD90", #electrical-power-engineering "Commissioning-component-tests-system-function-and-handover.lingua#r_27QFYZB06Z0RPZCJT47RG33HK4") { r_106H1NB80BZQYBC5FC0TSZ1WMV
**Read:** [Mechanical and Electrical Design of Hydroelectric Power Plants — USACE](../sources/Hydroelectric-Mechanical-and-Electrical-Design-USACE.lingua#r_1N0D32HTSXMVJ1VRW9TNTYV9P8), complete applicable design/construction and rehabilitation chapters; [Hydrogenerator Design Manual — Bureau of Reclamation](../sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30), entire design manual for the selected machine case; [Motor rewind studies and good practice — EASA/AEMT](../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP), both full studies and authorized complete good-practice method; [Electrical standards, edition and jurisdiction](../sources/Electrical-Standards-Edition-and-Jurisdiction.lingua#r_169QEF26N0C345MKSRWQY6KD90), complete actual applicable construction/test requirements.

An engineering design becomes a physical system through specified materials, parts, manufacturing/assembly, connections, inspection and test evidence. Trace a winding, transformer, switchboard, cable installation or auxiliary system from functional requirement to drawings, tolerances, ratings and the evidence that the built object matches them.

Read the complete applicable [Mechanical and Electrical Design of Hydroelectric Power Plants — USACE](../sources/Hydroelectric-Mechanical-and-Electrical-Design-USACE.lingua#r_1N0D32HTSXMVJ1VRW9TNTYV9P8) design and [Hydrogenerator Design Manual — Bureau of Reclamation](../sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30) manual, with the separate [Motor rewind studies and good practice — EASA/AEMT](../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP) reports/method for a rotating-machine repair case. Include conductor/core/insulation properties, mechanical support, cooling, clearances, joints, wiring/polarity and environmental conditions. Identify which details require the actual current standard or manufacturer method rather than a textbook approximation.

Compare design, manufacturing and as-built information, then connect each consequential difference to network, field, thermal, control or protection effects. A bill of parts alone is not a demonstrated functioning system; a successful simulation has not established insulation integrity or assembly quality. Suitable supervised fabrication/testing supplies practical evidence, while a complete documented case can teach the reasoning honestly. The next commissioning Record joins individual component evidence into the intended whole-system function.

**Continue:** [Commissioning, system function and handover](Commissioning-component-tests-system-function-and-handover.lingua#r_27QFYZB06Z0RPZCJT47RG33HK4).

**Return:** [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](../Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ).
